# Pinecone Strike, "Choose one or both" (CR 700.2): both modes at once. Mode 1 deals 3 damage to Bot2's Dori (3/2) and "if that
# creature would die this turn, exile it instead" (CR 614.1a), so it is exiled and not put into the graveyard; mode 2 destroys the
# Treasure token Dori made (an artifact token). Bot1's own Mox Jet is an artifact but not a token, so mode 2 refuses it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Pinecone Strike
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Dori, Bearer of Friends
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Dori, Bearer of Friends.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Dori, Bearer of Friends; Treasure Token
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pinecone Strike.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(Count: 0)
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Target(Dori, Bearer of Friends)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Target(Treasure Token)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Exile = Dori, Bearer of Friends
Bot2.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Pinecone Strike
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet
